    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Katsumoto in tsuite motto",
      "block": 26
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "shiritai.",
      "block": 27
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p6",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Kare wa katsu et heika no shi de\n                  ari, mottomo shinrai sareru soudan\n                  yaku deshita.",
      "block": 28
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Katsumoto was [once] the Emperor's\n                  teacher and his most trusted\n                  advisor.",
      "block": 29
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "You must understand, for centuries\n                  it was the Samurai who guarded\n                  Japan and fought her wars. But\n                  now the creation of a modern\n                  army...",
      "block": 30
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "... the Samurai, well, some have\n                  accepted the change, taken money\n                  instead. But some just couldn't\n                  bring themselves to do it. Thus,\n                  the rebellion.",
      "block": 31
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Who supplies their weapons?",
      "block": 32
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Buki wa don na juu desuka?",
      "block": 33
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p6",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Katsumoto wa samurai no michi o\n                  shirumono tachi ni agamerareteoru.\n                  Imasara tobidougu nanka tsukawan\n                  yo.",
      "block": 34
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "To those who honor the old ways,\n                  Katsumoto is a hero. He no longer\n                  dishonors himself by touching\n                  firearms.",
      "block": 35
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "He used them once, but now he\n                  doesn't?",
      "block": 36
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "He gave them up, yes. Felt they\n                  diminished Bushido, \"The Way of\n                  the Warrior.\" A code of behavior.\n                  Very serious stuff.",
      "block": 37
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "How well does he know him?",
      "block": 38
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "The General and Katsumoto fought\n                  together for the Emperor.",
      "block": 39
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "He fought with the samurai?",
      "block": 40
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "He is samurai.",
      "block": 41
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Vexing people, the samurai.\n                  Blood-thirsty, honorable, cruel,\n                  fabulously artistic. Wanted to\n                  write a book about them for years,\n                  but they tend to keep to\n                  themselves.",
      "block": 42
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Bastards still wear armor...",
      "block": 43
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Yes, and when the Irish were still\n                  comporting themselves in\n                  loincloths, these chaps were\n                  already the most sophisticated\n                  warriors on earth.",
      "block": 44
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I want detailed accounts of their\n                  battle tactics.",
      "block": 45
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I have several books on it.",
      "block": 46
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Just waiting to be translated.",
      "block": 47
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Captain'll be speaking the lingo\n                  in no time. You should hear him\n                  blather on in Blackfoot.",
      "block": 48
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "A fellow linguist! Come on, sir,\n                  a word or two in the savage\n                  tongue.",
      "block": 49
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Sorry, can't remember.",
      "block": 50
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Nonsense, you were among them for\n                  how long? Just \"hello\" or\n                  \"goodbye\" or \"cut his tongue out\n                  and boil him in oil.\"",
      "block": 51
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Early day tomorrow, Captain-\n                  darlin', time for bed, isn't it?",
      "block": 52
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I've always had a dread\n                  fascination with scalping. But\n                  I've never quite understood the\n                  technique.",
      "block": 53
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Ah, the English and their love of\n                  torture.",
      "block": 54
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I beg your pardon --",
      "block": 55
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "A lovely race -- the rack, the\n                  spike, and the bloody Tower of\n                  London.",
      "block": 56
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I was not speaking to you, you\n                  uncivilized hooligan.",
      "block": 57
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I sir am an American citizen and\n                  no longer under the boot heel of\n                  the English oppressor.",
      "block": 58
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "...First you need to grab a\n                  handful of hair and give it a\n                  quick jerk in order to loosen the\n                  skin. Then you saw the scalp off\n                  a little at a time because the\n                  blades are usually dull and the\n                  skin doesn't come off all at once.\n                  The problem is getting enough\n                  leverage when your hands are\n                  bloody...and slick. And, of\n                  course, the person being scalped\n                  in generally still alive and\n                  screaming. So a knee in the back\n                  tends to quiet them down and give\n                  you the purchase you need to\n                  finish the job.",
      "block": 59
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "ALGREN",
      "quote": "Hold the line... hold the line...",
      "block": 60
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "ALGREN",
      "quote": "FIRE!",
