      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Yes.   Sake.",
      "block": 73
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "\"November 26, 1868. The Washita\n                   River. For twelve years I have\n                   done nothing but carry out my\n                   orders to the best of my ability.\"",
      "block": 74
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "\"Tomorrow, if I do what is asked\n                   of me as a soldier-- \"",
      "block": 75
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p1",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "... Captain?",
      "block": 76
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Over there. Go. You.     Go.   You.",
      "block": 77
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "So where are we going?",
      "block": 78
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Are my words not correct?",
      "block": 79
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "You will?",
      "block": 80
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "If you would honor me.",
      "block": 81
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Then what do you want?",
      "block": 82
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "To know my enemy.",
      "block": 83
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I saw what you do to your enemies.",
      "block": 84
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Nathan Algren.",
      "block": 85
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I have questions.",
      "block": 86
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I have questions.",
      "block": 87
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Questions come later.",
      "block": 88
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "My brother-in-law. Hirotaro.",
      "block": 89
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "And the woman who cares for me?",
      "block": 90
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I killed her husband?",
      "block": 91
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "It was a good death.",
      "block": 92
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "You!   Come... Please...",
      "block": 93
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": "p10",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Why don't you tell him?",
      "block": 94
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p10",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "At least make him take a bath.",
      "block": 95
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "ALGREN",
      "quote": "No mind.",
      "block": 96
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "NOBUTADA",
      "quote": "Hai! No sword. No people watch.\n                    No enemy. No mind. You try.",
      "block": 97
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "ALGREN (V.O.)",
      "quote": "Is it bestowed at birth -- ?",
      "block": 98
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "ALGREN (V.O.)",
      "quote": "I am surprised to learn that the\n                    word, Samurai, means \"to serve.\"\n                    And that Bushido, The Way of the\n                    warrior, is much more than the\n                    study of war.",
      "block": 99
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "ALGREN (V.O.)",
      "quote": "To the samurai, training the mind\n                    is as important as the skills of\n                    combat.",
      "block": 100
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "ALGREN (V.O.)",
      "quote": "Zazen, or \"Sitting,\" seems to be a\n                    kind of contemplation. Not prayer\n                    as we might know it, but rather a\n                    way of quieting the mind.",
      "block": 101
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "NOBUTADA",
      "quote": "He's getting better, no?",
      "block": 102
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p11",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "NAKAO",
      "quote": "Yes.    But still so ugly.",
      "block": 103
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "ALGREN",
      "quote": "Cold.",
      "block": 104
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p12",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "HIGEN",
      "quote": "Samui.",
      "block": 105
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "ALGREN (subtitles)",
      "quote": "I'm cold.",
      "block": 106
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "ALGREN",
      "quote": "You're cold also.",
      "block": 107
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p12",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "HIGEN",
      "quote": "Hi!",
      "block": 108
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p13",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAGOJIRO (repeating)",
      "quote": "Hi.",
      "block": 109
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
